WEBVTT

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.955
Now that everyone in the Witch Realm
has acknowledged her skill in magic...

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:01.460
...Arusu has begun enjoying life
with her housemates, Sheila and Eva.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:05.232
But thanks to the recent furor
over the hydra fairy...

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:09.325
...the warlocks have embarked on
a mission to steal the fairies...

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.598
...that escaped from
the holding facility.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.364
Wait a minute.
Maybe there aren't just witches.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.269
Could there also be
male magic-wielders?

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.968
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.475 --> 00:03:00.003
The Warlock Sigma

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:05.743
Only one way remains to save those
who have been deprived of sunlight.

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:08.654
Concentrate the power
of all creatures...

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:11.190
...that have been released
from their cages...

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.893
...and awaken the sleeping Satan.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:21.428
But our Creator sealed
Satan away forever!

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.468
It is forbidden to...

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:26.005
Otherwise, the path will not open.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:27.899
A savior is coming!

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:30.567
A savior will surely save our people!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.403
Beta des riari.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:45.818
Wow, I've never seen it before.

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.888
What is this?

00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:52.432
Hey! I managed to summon it,
but what am I supposed to do now?

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:54.432
Throw it back. Discharge it.

00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:55.726
Discharge it?

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.927
| don't really get
what that means, but...

00:03:58.037 --> 00:03:58.731
Here!

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:03.307
Awesome!

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:04.901
That's incredible, Arusu!

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.480
You've mastered the lightning spell!

00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:10.884
I'm impressed that you came
this far in just three months.

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:12.441
Arusu?

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:16.979
I don't know. I'm bored.
It's the same old, same old...

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:17.856
Hey!

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:24.320
Hey, Sheila, I'm gonna try the
lightning spell too. So check it out!

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:28.095
There are tons of spells you need
to master before you do that one.

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:30.965
But... But I like these flashy ones!

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:31.513
You can't do it.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:33.869
You can't do it.
How can you know that unless she tries?

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.739
Oh, come on, just give me
an electric kabuyon leaf!

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:38.777
| said you can't do it, and that's that.

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:42.878
| bet you're just saying that
because you don't have any leaves!

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:47.144
We've heard a rumor that we're
out of electric kabuyon fairies.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.210
Right?

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:52.452
Stop wasting your breath on stupid
rumors like that and learn the mantra!

00:04:55.929 --> 00:04:57.897
Jeez, she's so stingy!

00:05:06.039 --> 00:05:07.131
For real?

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:13.479
Where did that girl go?

00:05:14.047 --> 00:05:15.071
That girl?

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:19.413
You know who I mean!
Who else would I be talking about?

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:22.350
She said she was going to
take a walk to the market.

00:05:23.289 --> 00:05:24.654
Give her this to hold on to.

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:25.691
You mean this?

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:29.689
| hate to admit it, but she's
better than I am at lightning magic.

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:32.694
Oh, you're so bashful, Sheila!

00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:37.466
Hey, Sheila!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:40.005
What's the big idea,
giving me this thing?

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:44.134
| have no intention of either capturing
fairies or fighting, and you know it!

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:45.506
Just hold on to it!

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:52.046
I told you! You've got
to stop capturing fairies!

00:05:58.091 --> 00:06:00.025
Be careful! Those are warlocks!

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:01.993
Uh, be careful? But how?

00:06:02.328 --> 00:06:03.955
This is bad news, Sheila!

00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:07.196
Hey, hey, time out!

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:10.598
Listen to me, I'm not
gonna fight you guys.

00:06:12.605 --> 00:06:14.095
I'm so scared!

00:06:14.173 --> 00:06:16.073
| just told you that
| didn't want to fight!

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:17.667
It's no use running away!

00:06:33.659 --> 00:06:34.217
Sheila!

00:06:34.327 --> 00:06:34.987
Sheila!

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:36.290
Dammit!

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:39.130
I'm gonna turn you all into ice!

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:42.495
I did it!

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:44.662
What?

00:06:45.104 --> 00:06:46.333
It's not gonna work, Sheila.

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:49.341
She's right. This is a time where
running away is the best strategy!

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:50.638
Running away is...

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.748
Well, can you run away from that?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.845
Just a minute, you!

00:06:59.052 --> 00:07:01.453
You let that fairy go right now!

00:07:04.657 --> 00:07:05.715
Now's your chance!

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:06.888
Take that!

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:14.962
What's going on?

00:07:16.069 --> 00:07:16.934
Amazing!

00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:19.699
All of the warlocks in a single blow.

00:07:20.039 --> 00:07:21.803
Something's not right, you know.

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:22.908
Arusu...

00:07:23.209 --> 00:07:26.668
I know it's magic, but
something's not right I'm telling you!

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:35.984
| wonder if Arusu is going to be okay.

00:07:36.089 --> 00:07:37.648
We couldn't avoid it.

00:07:37.723 --> 00:07:40.693
If we didn't get them first,
they would've gotten us.

00:07:41.127 --> 00:07:44.358
From now on,
that's how we're going to be fighting.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.626
We can't afford to be merciful.

00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:50.158
I wonder if Arusu will
be back by dinnertime?

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.872
Are you the one who did this?

00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:01.011
Hey. Are you one of the warlocks,
by any chance?

00:08:02.115 --> 00:08:05.949
Sorry, but I really have no desire
to go into battle with you guys.

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:08.646
You can boil me or fry me,
whatever you want.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.685
Well then, if you insist...

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:19.822
You can have that.

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:20.521
What?

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:25.104
If you plant that seed, one day it'll
come into bloom and grow tall again.

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:28.635
You know that's what we call life.

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:30.001
Right...

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.641
With a boy?

00:08:32.712 --> 00:08:33.235
Yeah.

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.744
He said his name was Sigma.

00:08:36.215 --> 00:08:39.014
But if he's a boy,
then he's a warlock, right?

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:42.322
| don't think every single
warlock is a bad guy.

00:08:42.388 --> 00:08:44.117
Are you out of your mind?

00:08:44.223 --> 00:08:45.748
He's our enemy!

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:47.259
He is not our enemy!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:49.756
We're at war.
The witches against the warlocks.

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:51.887
Then why don't you just stop fighting?

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:53.624
You saw it yourself, didn't you?

00:08:53.699 --> 00:08:56.396
Those guys are trying to
steal away all of the fairies!

00:08:56.469 --> 00:08:59.803
The fairies that you want to protect!
Isn't that why this afternoon, you...

00:08:59.872 --> 00:09:01.362
But that was going too far!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.272
They were attacking us!

00:09:03.342 --> 00:09:05.174
Well, I believe, you know!

00:09:05.311 --> 00:09:08.679
| believe that magic is
for making everyone happy!

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:09.905
Arusu...

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:12.984
I'm not going to go into battle.

00:09:13.085 --> 00:09:15.144
I'm never gonna use
magic to hurt anyone...

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.622
...to hurt any living creature again!

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.468
You can't whitewash things like that.

00:09:19.492 --> 00:09:20.926
You can't whitewash things like that.
My magic isn't...

00:09:21.027 --> 00:09:23.621
...a tool for you to use
in battle, Sheila!

00:09:32.939 --> 00:09:34.737
Feeling better today?

00:09:36.108 --> 00:09:38.736
Is that you?
The one who calls himself Sigma?

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:41.142
Sheila...

00:09:41.214 --> 00:09:43.308
Sorry, but due to
certain circumstances...

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:44.393
...We can't socialize with warlocks...

00:09:44.417 --> 00:09:45.907
...We can't socialize with warlocks...
You're at war, right?

00:09:46.652 --> 00:09:49.019
You knew that and
approached her anyway?

00:09:49.121 --> 00:09:50.054
What if I did?

00:09:50.156 --> 00:09:51.783
Sheila. Cut it out, will you?

00:09:51.857 --> 00:09:55.020
Then all the more... You've got
to stop leading this girl astray!

00:09:55.361 --> 00:09:57.329
Leading her astray? Me?

00:09:57.396 --> 00:09:59.797
Sigma, you'd better cut it out too.

00:09:59.899 --> 00:10:02.266
Why would I want to
do something like that?

00:10:02.868 --> 00:10:04.996
Well, because...

00:10:05.304 --> 00:10:09.036
I'll tell you one thing...
I'm not a pawn of the Powers That Be.

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:12.972
I'm neither an ally of the
warlocks nor of the witches.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.777
I am who I am.

00:10:16.882 --> 00:10:19.647
I'm not a puppet of authority like you.

00:10:20.152 --> 00:10:21.449
Hey, I'm not either...

00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:24.683
Then what's your reason
for fighting the warlocks?

00:10:27.493 --> 00:10:30.190
Bad news, Sheila!
This is really bad news!

00:10:31.897 --> 00:10:33.865
Come back here, all of you!

00:10:33.933 --> 00:10:36.664
This area is off-limits
to unauthorized personnel!

00:10:38.871 --> 00:10:41.340
If they're so flustered about it...

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.341
...then they really must not
want us to see what's inside!

00:10:44.944 --> 00:10:45.706
Stop!

00:10:45.778 --> 00:10:47.712
You are not to go any further! Stop!

00:11:08.601 --> 00:11:10.194
What's up with this?

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.268
We've been deceived.

00:11:13.606 --> 00:11:16.439
All this time,
they've been deceiving us!

00:11:16.942 --> 00:11:18.774
What are we gonna do, Sheila?

00:11:18.911 --> 00:11:22.541
Everyone knows about
the fairies' escape now!

00:11:33.492 --> 00:11:36.484
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.966 --> 00:11:45.426
Sheila's Quandary

00:11:47.173 --> 00:11:47.799
What?

00:11:53.179 --> 00:11:54.010
Stop it!

00:11:54.113 --> 00:11:55.945
Stop it right now, all of you!

00:11:56.082 --> 00:11:57.049
Shut up.

00:11:57.616 --> 00:12:00.517
You've duped us all this time.
So don't tell us what to do!

00:12:00.619 --> 00:12:02.314
It was all a bunch of lies!

00:12:02.421 --> 00:12:04.947
The truth is this is
all the fairies we have!

00:12:05.491 --> 00:12:07.220
All of you, please, just stop!

00:12:07.293 --> 00:12:10.923
Getting so worked up
will only make you hungry!

00:12:13.499 --> 00:12:14.057
Whatever!

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:14.622
Huh?

00:12:15.101 --> 00:12:16.762
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:12:18.671 --> 00:12:20.696
Hey, Sheila! What are you doing?

00:12:20.773 --> 00:12:21.934
Stop it, Sheila!

00:12:22.007 --> 00:12:24.101
You want me to just stand by and watch?

00:12:24.176 --> 00:12:25.610
Now you've done it!

00:12:25.678 --> 00:12:27.203
Don't mess with us!

00:12:30.449 --> 00:12:32.611
All of you are under arrest!

00:12:34.787 --> 00:12:37.017
Hey, hold on! They're just kids!

00:12:37.223 --> 00:12:39.783
Stop it! Stop being so rough with them!

00:12:41.293 --> 00:12:43.352
Oh, don't be such a goody-goody!

00:12:49.001 --> 00:12:52.027
We cannot let this matter
go now that they know...

00:12:52.304 --> 00:12:55.171
...about the Witch Realm's crisis.

00:12:56.575 --> 00:12:59.476
| am looking to you to handle the rest.

00:13:02.381 --> 00:13:04.543
How many of the fairies escaped?

00:13:04.617 --> 00:13:06.016
Most of them.

00:13:06.552 --> 00:13:08.577
| suppose we'll have
to start over again.

00:13:08.687 --> 00:13:12.715
Perhaps we should let
Atelia take care of this?

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:20.363
Those girls will most likely
end up being...

00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:22.935
...imprisoned in the holding facility.

00:13:23.569 --> 00:13:25.367
And you are to blame.

00:13:25.938 --> 00:13:29.374
I told you again and again.
No one must ever find out.

00:13:30.309 --> 00:13:33.506
And though you were the
initial cause of the crisis...

00:13:33.579 --> 00:13:36.981
...| still had faith in you.
I trusted you, you know.

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:40.544
| am relieving you of
your post as leader.

00:13:40.619 --> 00:13:41.586
Atelia!

00:13:49.862 --> 00:13:51.455
Didn't I tell you?

00:13:52.131 --> 00:13:54.566
There's no point believing in authority.

00:13:54.633 --> 00:13:56.863
It's just as short-lived as a bubble.

00:14:00.906 --> 00:14:03.238
I'm impressed that
you made it this far inside.

00:14:03.342 --> 00:14:06.573
Well, since Witch Heaven is protected
by the grand master's barrier...

00:14:07.346 --> 00:14:10.043
...even I can't enter the village.

00:14:12.451 --> 00:14:13.577
Stay away from me.

00:14:13.819 --> 00:14:15.913
You can only believe in yourself.

00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:18.456
That's the kind of girl
you really are, aren't you?

00:14:19.825 --> 00:14:22.055
How can you possibly understand me?

00:14:22.261 --> 00:14:23.456
But I do understand!

00:14:23.529 --> 00:14:26.658
You know why
Because you and I have the same smell!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.127
You and I smell the same?

00:14:30.002 --> 00:14:31.902
Want to leave this world?

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:33.937
Just you... and me?

00:14:38.811 --> 00:14:41.644
Welcome home, Sheila! Aren't you hungry?

00:14:41.714 --> 00:14:43.091
| just made a batch of pancakes...

00:14:43.115 --> 00:14:44.981
| just made a batch of pancakes...
We won't go after the fairies tomorrow.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:45.516
Huh?

00:14:45.584 --> 00:14:48.884
Hey, Sheila,
to what do we owe this surprise?

00:14:48.988 --> 00:14:51.616
Did that old lady give you
a hard time again?

00:14:51.757 --> 00:14:53.535
She dismissed me from my post.

00:14:53.559 --> 00:14:54.424
She dismissed me from my post.
Well...

00:14:54.593 --> 00:14:58.496
That's a good thing. You won't have to
do those tiresome tasks anymore.

00:14:58.597 --> 00:14:59.462
Arusu...

00:15:00.099 --> 00:15:03.729
Like I said, we're not going
after fairies tomorrow.

00:15:04.036 --> 00:15:07.028
I don't know about Eva, but
that should suit you just fine, right?

00:15:07.206 --> 00:15:07.968
Sheila!

00:15:08.073 --> 00:15:09.666
Just leave me alone.

00:15:12.711 --> 00:15:14.475
You can only believe in yourself.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.049
That's the kind of girl
you really are, aren't you?

00:15:18.317 --> 00:15:19.216
He's right.

00:15:20.019 --> 00:15:22.386
| never believed in anything but myself.

00:15:27.359 --> 00:15:29.851
So when was it that ...

00:15:34.099 --> 00:15:36.534
When was it... that I changed?

00:15:42.808 --> 00:15:46.335
Sheila said we don't have to
capture any fairies, didn't she?

00:15:46.579 --> 00:15:48.877
So why are we... What's going on?

00:15:48.981 --> 00:15:52.713
And weren't you against us
capturing fairies, Arusu?

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:57.783
All right. What do you want to do, Eva?

00:15:57.957 --> 00:15:58.685
Me?

00:15:59.325 --> 00:16:02.693
Well, of course, if we want to have
the Curse of Eternal Youth lifted...

00:16:02.795 --> 00:16:04.923
...we've got to capture the fairies...

00:16:05.598 --> 00:16:07.623
But at the same time, I'd like to see...

00:16:07.733 --> 00:16:10.703
...the fairies live in freedom,
just like you said.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.034
Oh, I don't know what I want!

00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:13.663
Huh?

00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:19.240
But I really like Sheila.
And I really like you too, Arusu.

00:16:19.345 --> 00:16:22.474
So I want to cooperate
with what you're both doing.

00:16:22.581 --> 00:16:25.312
| wanted to help. That's all I wanted!

00:16:25.417 --> 00:16:26.213
Eva!

00:16:27.152 --> 00:16:30.349
But now Sheila tells us we don't
have to capture them anymore.

00:16:30.456 --> 00:16:33.756
And the minute Sheila tells us
we don't have to catch any...

00:16:33.826 --> 00:16:36.056
...you start trying to capture fairies!

00:16:36.161 --> 00:16:38.960
I have no idea! You're so twisted!

00:16:39.031 --> 00:16:41.830
Wait a second!
I'm not twisted in any way!

00:16:41.934 --> 00:16:45.199
And when did I ever say
| was gonna capture a fairy?

00:16:46.672 --> 00:16:48.140
That's not what I'm doing...

00:16:48.207 --> 00:16:52.508
| just want to protect the fairies
from the warlocks. That's all.

00:16:53.779 --> 00:16:55.338
Oh, is that it?

00:16:55.748 --> 00:16:57.716
What do you say? Want to join me?

00:16:57.783 --> 00:16:59.376
Yes! I'll do it!

00:17:00.886 --> 00:17:02.877
Oh, wait! I'm not trying to catch you.

00:17:02.988 --> 00:17:07.016
| just want to protect you!
So come back here, please!

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:12.759
Arusu, look! I caught one!

00:17:15.167 --> 00:17:16.191
Arusu?

00:17:16.802 --> 00:17:20.568
You know what? Without Sheila here,
| just can't seem to get into it.

00:17:20.639 --> 00:17:21.970
Arusu!

00:17:25.844 --> 00:17:29.109
About my fairy capturing
and my future as a witch...

00:17:29.248 --> 00:17:31.080
| started over with a clean slate.

00:17:31.183 --> 00:17:33.777
You're being really pliant about this.

00:17:34.453 --> 00:17:36.751
Because I believe
what you said is right.

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:37.516
Right?

00:17:37.956 --> 00:17:39.167
In that case, you and I should...

00:17:39.191 --> 00:17:40.750
That's one thing I can't do.

00:17:40.859 --> 00:17:41.826
Why not?

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:46.028
| still don't know what it is
that I should do with my life.

00:17:46.165 --> 00:17:50.068
And I need to find out what it is
or else nothing would have changed...

00:17:50.169 --> 00:17:52.501
...even if I did leave
this world with you.

00:17:53.005 --> 00:17:54.769
That's the feeling I got.

00:17:56.208 --> 00:17:57.198
And also...

00:17:58.877 --> 00:18:02.279
And also I don't know
anything about you.

00:18:03.048 --> 00:18:06.882
My father took a stand against Grande
and was killed for it.

00:18:07.219 --> 00:18:07.913
Grande?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.148
The general of the warlock tribe.

00:18:10.823 --> 00:18:13.349
That's why I refuse to obey authority.

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:16.057
I'm going to follow
the path I believe in.

00:18:16.628 --> 00:18:18.596
That means everything to me.

00:18:21.533 --> 00:18:24.127
Eva, let's head home now, okay?

00:18:24.269 --> 00:18:25.668
Sure, okay!

00:18:28.907 --> 00:18:30.432
Arusu!

00:18:30.943 --> 00:18:32.968
Oh, look, it's just some kids.

00:18:33.078 --> 00:18:35.240
Hand over that fairy.

00:18:36.749 --> 00:18:39.775
You summoned me,
| appeared... da-da-da-da!

00:18:39.885 --> 00:18:40.681
Who are you?

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:43.778
I'm against capturing fairies!
I'm against war!

00:18:43.889 --> 00:18:46.381
I'm the Witch of Justice, Arusu!

00:18:46.492 --> 00:18:49.985
That's the one! The little witch
who cast a lightning spell.

00:18:50.095 --> 00:18:50.755
What?

00:18:50.863 --> 00:18:51.887
Arusu!

00:18:52.197 --> 00:18:54.393
Just do what you did the other day!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:58.903
| said I wasn't ever going to
use magic to hurt anyone again!

00:18:59.204 --> 00:19:02.834
But if you don't use magic,
they're gonna steal the fairies, and...

00:19:02.941 --> 00:19:04.670
...we won't be safe either!

00:19:04.743 --> 00:19:06.108
Stop mumbling!

00:19:06.178 --> 00:19:09.079
You may be a lightning spell-caster,
but if you don't hand over that fairy...

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:10.706
...you won't live to regret it!

00:19:13.619 --> 00:19:16.088
Hey! These trees are
alive too, you know!

00:19:16.188 --> 00:19:18.555
You can't burn them like that,
the poor things!

00:19:21.693 --> 00:19:22.819
Take them out!

00:19:24.363 --> 00:19:25.125
Eva!

00:19:26.498 --> 00:19:27.693
Dammit!

00:19:30.803 --> 00:19:31.827
Dammit!

00:19:35.741 --> 00:19:36.799
Stop it!

00:19:37.676 --> 00:19:39.542
Come back here!

00:19:39.678 --> 00:19:40.702
Arusu!

00:19:44.116 --> 00:19:45.242
Those two...

00:19:50.789 --> 00:19:51.984
Sheila!

00:19:52.124 --> 00:19:52.647
Hey!

00:19:54.526 --> 00:19:58.588
Sheila, I'm going to go rescue
the fairies the warlocks stole.

00:19:58.831 --> 00:20:00.162
What are you talking about?

00:20:00.232 --> 00:20:00.942
What just happened?

00:20:00.966 --> 00:20:02.434
What just happened?
Just come with us!

00:20:05.337 --> 00:20:08.432
We can'tdoit...
Not unless you're with us!

00:20:17.349 --> 00:20:25.313
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.557 --> 00:20:33.557
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.733 --> 00:20:42.733
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.976 --> 00:20:49.540
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.648 --> 00:20:53.881
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.653 --> 00:20:58.886
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.991 --> 00:21:03.553
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.762 --> 00:21:08.928
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.034 --> 00:21:12.095
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.572 --> 00:21:18.203
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.802
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.913 --> 00:21:28.913
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.088 --> 00:21:35.822
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.928 --> 00:21:40.092
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
